    "text": "Champions League 2017 Aichi was held at Fukiage Hall in Nagoya on 5 May 2017, during Pokémon Card Festa 2017, one of the season's seven tournaments, which earned Championship Points toward Japan's national final in June. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
